asset:        transitions.json
title:        EffectCraft Transitions animation presets (Fade In/Out, Wipe In from Left/Right/Top/Bottom, Diagonal Sweep In, Wipe Out to Right, Clock Reveal, Fan Open, Clock Wipe Out, Blinds Open/Close, Slats Down, Pixel Dissolve In/Out, Mosaic Fade In, Card Flip In/Out, Grid Doors In, Lens Pop In, Line Sweep In, Jaws Close In)
author:       EffectCraft contributors
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-11 by vangel76 (Claude Code agent, #757)
notes:        Effect choices, values and key timings written from scratch for EffectCraft on its own Transition effects; not derived from any Adobe preset (.ffx) or its values.

asset:        Motion animation presets (Quick Zoom Hit, Soft Impact, Impact Shake, Vertical Shake, Spin Hit, Flash Impact, Fast Push In, Zoom Punch Out, Bounce Pop, Snap Slide In, Tilt Punch, Flicker Hit)
author:       EffectCraft contributors
source:       Original native presets authored from scratch using EffectCraft's own transform and Brightness & Contrast controls; informed by common short-form editing patterns from the user-supplied FastFX reference pack
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
notes:        No Premiere Pro extension code, Adobe project files, overlays, or sound assets were imported. Presets use EffectCraft-native effects and keyframes.
